BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lali Ayguadé Company — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+02:00":20261024T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261025T200000
DTSTAMP:20261011T193532Z
UID:5381b658ae901c8734522ab2f102@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:The show primarily explores the stark contrast between the vir
 tual world—including artificial intelligence and social networks—and t
 he authentic reality of our everyday lives. This dichotomy is depicted thr
 ough a nuanced interplay of revelation and concealment\, examining the fa
 çade we present online versus our concealed true selves. While we often p
 ortray a façade of positivity in digital spaces\, the show delves into th
 e hidden negativity of our reality that we typically choose to keep privat
 e. On social media\, everyone has the infinite freedom to shape and presen
 t their image according to their own vision of authenticity. Still\, it is
  striking how eerily similar all profiles seem. We engage\nCategory: Multi
 disciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule
 /lali-ayguade-company
LOCATION:Centro Danza Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/lali-ayguade-company
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
